Z||000016||Smoooooth GT||06-05-2001||11:57 PM||||I agree with Seanh....   90% of car that are made in America, don't have 12"x12" vent's over there motor's. Yes without the vent's the engine compartment would be warmer,BUT It would'nt overheat because of the vent's being covered by those scoop's.  <BR>This is ONLY MY OPINION...  No flames please...                  Steve<P>------------------<BR>aka..FieroSEt<BR>Fiero_87GT@yahoo.com<BR>cell.. 903 445 0849<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_6.JPG"> ||||reg||1
